<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-098-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.433621" lon="-120.922153"><name>SC26-098-C</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.9 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 50/100; not catch probability. Center 42 ft; nearby 38–63 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. Parts of the investigation circle are shallower than 40 ft. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-078</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.433739620600235" lon="-120.92121326132575"/><trkpt lat="35.433108861573146" lon="-120.92122947952971"/><trkpt lat="35.4330054773248" lon="-120.92046111153903"/><trkpt lat="35.43219070783018" lon="-120.92026177702941"/><trkpt lat="35.43208162408752" lon="-120.9191631298662"/><trkpt lat="35.432350050979615" lon="-120.91904607581503"/><trkpt lat="35.43234245755645" lon="-120.9186056886714"/><trkpt lat="35.432612782446064" lon="-120.91859872950191"/><trkpt lat="35.43281767219807" lon="-120.92002535678479"/><trkpt lat="35.433542333602595" lon="-120.92022700812446"/><trkpt lat="35.433548024551996" lon="-120.92055730370697"/><trkpt lat="35.433728241334165" lon="-120.92055266841307"/><trkpt lat="35.433739620600235" lon="-120.92121326132575"/></trkseg></trk><trk><name>SC-AREA-080</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.436490252